+  # automatically arranges for build-time custom commands that reference
+  # this target to be run under Node (via CMAKE_CROSSCOMPILING_EMULATOR),
+  # but the resulting program still needs -sNODERAWFS=1 so that its normal
+  # std::ifstream/DBM file I/O against real paths on disk actually works
